#: src/Support/ReminderCall.php:146
msgid "Hi %1$s,\n\nJust a reminder that you're on %2$s at %3$s, %4$s.\n\nCan't make it? Open the bot and tap the task to cancel, or ask someone to take it over with 🔁 Take over a task under /me in the bot."
