#: src/Support/TakeoverService.php:110
msgid "📨 Request sent. %1$s decides whether you take over their task: %2$s at %3$s, %4$s.\n\nThey have until %5$s to answer. If they do not answer by then, they keep the task."
msgstr "📨 Petición enviada. %1$s decide si te quedas con su tarea: %2$s en %3$s, %4$s.\n\nTiene hasta %5$s para responder. Si no responde antes, se queda con la tarea."

